WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:06.169
Take Recorder records gameplay animation, live performances, and other sources directly

2
00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:07.849
into Unreal Engine.

3
00:00:07.849 --> 00:00:13.449
By recording and managing takes in Sequencer, you can achieve a highly iterative workflow.

4
00:00:13.449 --> 00:00:18.170
Take Recorder is a valuable tool for recording actors' performances directly within the

5
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:23.070
engine, eliminating the need for external DCC, and it's especially useful when

6
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.629
multiple takes are required.

7
00:00:26.629 --> 00:00:31.170
Live Link is a plugin that lets users stream animation data from external sources

8
00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.149
directly into Unreal Engine.

9
00:00:33.149 --> 00:00:37.890
It allows you to preview your performance work in real time.

10
00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:43.229
Live Link Face allows for markerless facial performance capture using a mobile device

11
00:00:43.229 --> 00:00:49.609
such as an iPhone to directly animate and record in engine.

12
00:00:49.609 --> 00:00:53.890
Unreal VCam lets you create complex camera movements and effects through the use of

13
00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:59.530
external devices, like smartphones or motion capture systems, to be directly applied to

14
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:02.369
a virtual camera in Unreal Engine.

15
00:01:02.369 --> 00:01:07.849
VCam is widely used for pre-visualization film shots, virtual production where actors

16
00:01:07.849 --> 00:01:12.810
can interact with the digital environment, and creating cinematic sequences, such as

17
00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.180
in games.

18
00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:19.439
One of the highly requested updates to Unreal VCam was to increase the functionality

19
00:01:19.439 --> 00:01:21.359
on Android devices.

20
00:01:21.359 --> 00:01:26.840
While VCam has been previously supported on Android devices, functionality was significantly

21
00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:29.879
reduced compared to the iOS version.

22
00:01:29.879 --> 00:01:34.120
The latest updates to Unreal VCam for Android have brought significant functionality

23
00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.120
and quality of life.
